{"full":"hf:build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop","spaceId":"build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop","name":"Lesky's Shop","source":"huggingface","description":"Win a board duel to rewrite rules while your opponent lies.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","game","llm","strategy","hackathon","track:wood","sponsor:nvidia","sponsor:modal","achievement:offbrand","achievement:sharing","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":7,"created":"2026-06-14T22:06:52.000Z","updated":"2026-06-15T19:52:27.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://build-small-hackathon-leskys-shop.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.446Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.446Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.446Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚗️","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["\"Centuries of practice and you thought YOU could beat ME? Delightful.\"","A hand-drawn, AI-powered board game built for the Build Small Hackathon — Thousand Token Wood track.","You duel the ancient goblin Lesky across a shifting board. Win a round and you earn the right to write a law in plain English. Type anything — \"corners are worth double\", \"nobody can place in the center\", \"clashes split the value\" — and the LLM translates it into a structured rule that reshapes the board on the spot."],"features":["Free-text law writing — the core mechanic. The player types a rule in natural language; the LLM translates it into a validated game effect. There is no dropdown, no preset list. Any legal rule the player can describe,…","Lesky lies in character — the goblin announces fake law descriptions generated by the LLM, personalized to the game state and round number.","In-character chat — argue with Lesky mid-game. He knows the current board, the scroll, the scores, and will be insufferably smug about it.","Adaptive taunts — Lesky reacts differently depending on whether he won or lost the round, pre-generated in the background so there's no wait.","Fully voiced cast — every character speaks using Chatterbox TTS (via Modal): Lesky taunts and welcomes you in his own voice, The Monster growls through both its rounds, and if you beat them both… a surprise awaits, also…"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"677a3e9cb2a6df9361e7f9debd2287d83696d8d43a65270e1977847c0f51ff2d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.529Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.529Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"\"Centuries of practice and you thought YOU could beat ME? Delightful.\"","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A hand-drawn, AI-powered board game built for the Build Small Hackathon — Thousand Token Wood track.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"677a3e9cb2a6df9361e7f9debd2287d83696d8d43a65270e1977847c0f51ff2d","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.529Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-15T19:52:27.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/Leskys_Shop/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:55.529Z","hash":"677a3e9cb2a6df9361e7f9debd2287d83696d8d43a65270e1977847c0f51ff2d","originalBytes":7156,"storedBytes":7156,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["lesky","game","llm","law","modal","board","round","gradio","one","engine","every","goblin","monster","any","character","css","each","hackathon","hand-drawn","his","nvidia","rule","scroll","shop","wood","app.py","art","awards","bash","beat","both","catch","cell","chat","chips","cleverness","custom","fully